# EngIntel policy files: .engintel/architecture.json (the contract),
# baseline.json (existing debt), config.json, and ignore.
#
# Copy these lines into .github/CODEOWNERS and replace the team. Then, in a
# branch ruleset for your default branch, enable "Require review from Code
# Owners" and require the EngIntel status check. Without both, anyone (or any
# agent) who can open a pull request can weaken the policy that judges it.
#
# /.engintel/cache/ is derived and gitignored; it needs no owner.

/.engintel/                 @your-org/architecture-owners
/.github/CODEOWNERS         @your-org/architecture-owners
/.github/workflows/         @your-org/architecture-owners
